ribes a pharmacological experiment using JQ1 for male contraception and contains no generative model or foundation model claims."}, "round-A_architecture_reviewer_paper_type": "unclear", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_generative_model_present": "no", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_foundation_model_evidence": "no", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_primary_exclusion_code": "EC3_not_generative", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_uncertainty_reason": "paper_type_unclear", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_evidence_for_text_component": "not_assessed", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_evidence_for_text_bio_bridge": "not_assessed", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_evidence_for_generative_model": "none", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_boundary_case": "clear_exclude", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_decision_rationale": "The abstract describes a pharmacological experiment using JQ1 for male contraception and contains no generative model or foundation model claims.", "pilot_roundA_scope_gate": "UNCERTAIN", "pilot_roundA_architecture_gate": "UNCERTAIN", "pilot_needs_adjudication": true, "round-B_adjudicator_output": {"paper_type": "unclear", "bio_modality_present": "yes", "text_component_present": "no", "text_bio_bridge_present": "no", "generative_model_present": "no", "foundation_model_evidence": "no", "primary_exclusion_code": "EC3_not_generative", "uncertainty_reason": "none", "evidence_for_text_component": "none", "evidence_for_text_bio_bridge": "none", "evidence_for_generative_model": "none", "boundary_case": "clear_exclude", "decision_rationale": "The abstract reports a pharmacological study of JQ1 for male contraception with no mention of natural‑language text, text‑bio alignment, or a generative architecture. Consequently it lacks a generative text‑bio model and is excluded under EC3_not_generative."}, "round-B_adjudicator_paper_type": "unclear", "round-B_adjudicator_bio_modality_present": "yes", "round-B_adjudicator_text_component_present": "no", "round-B_adjudicator_text_bio_brid