rk_resource","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"benchmark_resource","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a perspective with a curated database of metabolomics tools, not a primary model paper. The abstract discusses the landscape of software and recent LLM-based tools, but no candidate text-bio model is presented.","evidence_snippet":"\"we offer a curated database that aggregates 746 mass spectrometry- and spectroscopy-based tools\""},{"record_id":"update_2026-08-09__rec_000021","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"A primary model on cell-free DNA sequence patterns, but the abstract gives no natural-language text component. The \"language model\" here is over biological sequences, not text.","evidence_snippet":"\"cell-free DNA language model\"; \"learns fragment-level sequence patterns in tumor-derived cell-free DNA\""},{"record_id":"update_2026-08-09__rec_000022","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a commentary/perspective on AI in drug discovery. It discusses opportunities and challenges rather than introducing a new text-bio model.","evidence_snippet":"\"this commentary aims to present a perspective\""},{"record_id":"update_2026-08-09__rec_000023","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a scoping review on nursing roles and education in precision oncology. The generative AI phrase refers to a search method, not the