./data/input_representation_taxonomy_2026-07-11/runs/classification_fixed_r2/shard_02/records/full_2026-07-06__rec_000090/prompt.txt:2560:- [31] Antoine Bosselut, Zeming Chen, Angelika Romanou, Antoine Bonnet, Alejandro Hernández-Cano, Badr 1060 Alkhamissi, Kyle Matoba, Francesco Salvi, Matteo Pagliardini, Simin Fan, et al. Meditron: Open medical 1061 foundation models adapted for clinical practice. 2024. 1062
